# SEO Tracking Rules

## Session Start
At the start of every conversation, read these files before doing anything else:
- `seo-tracking/CONTEXT.md`
- `seo-tracking/tasks/todo.md`
- `seo-tracking/tasks/lessons.md`
- `seo-tracking/tasks/decisions.md`

## Auto-Update Task Files
After every task, correction, or decision — without being asked:
- `seo-tracking/tasks/todo.md` — mark completed items done, add newly discovered tasks
- `seo-tracking/tasks/lessons.md` — append: `[YYYY-MM-DD] - [what was corrected or learned] - [rule going forward]`
- `seo-tracking/tasks/decisions.md` — append only when an architectural or approach decision was made: `[YYYY-MM-DD] - [decision] - [why]`

One line per entry. Do not ask permission. Just do it.
Only update files within `seo-tracking/` — never touch other project folders.
Never modify `seo-tracking/CONTEXT.md` — that is maintained manually.